    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a SmartTools user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to select the Service layer and view Service test results as points on a map, then open details for an individual result",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that I can investigate service state and associated cell information at the location of a test.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue/Change Description:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Provide Service as a selectable map layer. Service results remain hidden until the layer is selected; when selected, load only matching authorised results as selectable points."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Selecting a point opens a Service details dialog. Display a sortable and filterable table containing: MSISDN, Test Time, Signal, Band, Service, Data Technology, PLMN and Serving Cell. When cell-neighbour data is returned, show each neighbour in its own labelled details table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Show a loading state while details load and an error state if they cannot be retrieved; do not show stale or misleading data. Route Replay is out of scope."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the Service layer has not been selected, when the map is displayed, then no Service test-result points are shown."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the user selects the Service layer and authorised data is available, when results load, then matching results are shown as selectable map points."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the user selects a Service point, when its details load successfully, then a dialog displays MSISDN, Test Time, Signal, Band, Service, Data Technology, PLMN and Serving Cell."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the Service details table is displayed, when the user sorts or filters a supported column, then the displayed rows reflect that operation."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given cell-neighbour data is returned, when the dialog is displayed, then each neighbour is shown in a separate labelled details table."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given details are loading or cannot be loaded, when the dialog is opened, then a loading or error state is shown without stale data."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rule"
        },
